1. kuch dair mein lut jayega zehra ka bhara ghar<br>
har simt qayamat ka nazar ayega manzar<br>
rakhenge sitamgaar yeh naize pe mera sar<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
2. baaqi nahi akber sa pisar kya karoo jikar<br>
mitne ko nahi daag -e- jigar kya karoo jikar<br>
aata nahin ab kuch bhi nazar kya karoo jikar<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
3. hum kho chuke maqtal me behen noore nazar ko<br>
dekha hai inn aankhon ne ujadtey huwe ghar ko<br>
maulat nahi ab fatima zehra ke pisar ko<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
<br>
4. kya hoga suno phir yeh batana nahi hoga<br>
jata hoo ke ab laut ke aana nahin hoga<br>
seeney pe sakina ko sulana nahin hoga<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
5. kya zulm sitamgar na dhayenge mere baad<br>
yeh qaima e athaar jalayenge mere baad<br>
yeh meri sakina ko rulayenge mere baad<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
6. tanhaayi meri karti hai abbas ka matam<br>
binaayi sada roti hain akber ka liye gham<br>
mehshar mein batayenge har ek daag jigar hum<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
7. abbas nahin qasim -o- akber bhi nahi hain<br>
veeran hain jhoola mera asghar bhi nahi hain<br>
lashkar ke muqabil mera lashkar bhi nahi hai<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .<br>
<br>
8. hum hoyenge be aas nahi koi saharey<br>
cheenengey sitamgar rida sar se tumharey<br>
yeh kehke fareed ibne ali ran ko sidharey<br>
jata hain yeh mazloom . . . . .